  1639                              <1> ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
  1640                              <1> ; measure_clock -> [ST_MHZ] (MHz x 10): a timing loop of 32 DIVs per
  1641                              <1> ; pass is built in RAM (0:7C00) and timed by PIT channel 2. The setup
  1642                              <1> ; uses 8 DIVs per pass; the longer pass makes the reading much less
  1643                              <1> ; sensitive to slow code fetches while the cache is still off (early in
  1644                              <1> ; POST). A reading not within 1/16 of a standard clock is not shown.
  1645                              <1> ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
  1646                              <1> measure_clock:
  1647 0000041B 06                  <1>     push es
  1648 0000041C 68C007              <1>     push TLOOP_SEG
  1649 0000041F 07                  <1>     pop  es
